flowchart LR
  O[Original artifact + SHA-256] --> W[Wrapper/media recognition]
  W --> V[Bounds / checksum / geometry validation]
  V -->|extractable| C[Child member bytes + SHA-256]
  V -->|protected or non-file-oriented| E[Structured evidence-only record]
  C --> N[Recursive inspection]
  N --> P[Parent-child provenance chain]
  E --> P
  P --> L[Library/report relative links]
